  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.28 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Medicine",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.28 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Medicine. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.28, below, shall apply to the professions regulated by the board of medicine under RSA 329 and RSA 328-D:\n\nTable 1002.28 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Medicine\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nUnrestricted permanent physician license or administrative physician license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $385\n\nCompact physician license per RSA 329-C application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial or renewal | 2 years | $385\n\nTemporary physician license application processing and licensing | max. of 6 months | $55\n\nLocum tenens physician license application processing and licensing | 100 consec. calendar days | $165\n\nSpecial camp license or visiting professor license application processing and licensing | as indicated on license | $82\n\nResident training license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $55\n\nPhysician assistant license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $192\n\nSource. #13290-A, INTERIM, eff 11-19-21, EXPIRED: 5-18-22\n\nNew. #13420, eff 8-8-22; ss by #13703, eff 8-1-23 (formerly Plc 1002.26); ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
